title: Aelius_Day_Start
---
<<set $aeliusDayRound1AresDone = false>>
<<set $aeliusDayRound1HeraDone = false>>
<<set $aeliusDayRound1AphroditeDone = false>>

<<set $aeliusDayRound2AresDone = false>>
<<set $aeliusDayRound2HeraDone = false>>
<<set $aeliusDayRound2AphroditeDone = false>>

<<set $aeliusDrink = "none">>
<<set $aeliusMainFood = "none">>
<<set $aeliusDessert = "none">>
<<set $aeliusLastCookingStyle = "none">>

<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "main_kitchen_bg_2">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Positive] Ah, welcome, Aelius dear. Are you ready to begin the day?
Aelius: [Positive] I suppose so. I think I’m starting to get the hang of your routine.
Hestia: [Neutral] Well... today might throw you off a little bit.
Aelius: [Neutral] ... What’s that supposed to mean?
Aelius: [Neutral] Is there something different going on today?
Hestia: [Positive] You could say that, yes.
Hestia: [Positive] Seeing how you’ve had a rather positive impact on the Olympians, I invited a few of the others today.
Hestia: [Positive] I asked Hera, Ares, and Aphrodite if they would come in together.
Hestia: [Positive] They have some issues with each other and some of the other Olympians, so I thought you might be able to try and talk to them.
Aelius: [Neutral] I don’t know... I’m not sure how I could help them. I’m just starting to get to know them and their issues.
Aelius: [Neutral] Besides, I’m just a mortal. Why would they listen to me?
Aelius: [Neutral] Especially Ares, he’s arrogant and rude. I don’t think he would even give me a chance.
Hestia: [Positive] I think you’ll be able to do more than you think.
Hestia: [Positive] You haven’t spent all your life up here like the others and I.
Hestia: [Positive] I think you having a fresh perspective will do wonders for change.
Aelius: [Neutral] You really think so?
Hestia: [Positive] My dear, I know you can.
Hestia: [Positive] Oh, as for Ares being... difficult, all you need to do is provide an incentive for him.
Hestia: [Positive] I hear he really enjoys sweets, so use that as you see fit.
Aelius: [Positive] Heh, for such an intimidating guy, I hadn’t expected that.
Hestia: [Positive] Like I said, you have everything you need to help be the change we all need, so you got this.
Aelius: [Positive] Thanks Hestia!
Hestia: [Neutral] Ah! Here comes Hera now.

<<Fade "#000000" 0 1 0.35>>
<<wait 0.4>>
<<jump Aelius_Day_GuestArrival>>
===


