title: Aelius_Day_AphroditeArrivalBottle
---
Aelius: [Neutral] Have a seat with the others, please.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] Why are we here, mortal?
Ares: [Negative] Hestia said something about “resolving issues.”

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] Yes, I am also quite curious.

Aelius: [Neutral] Ah, so...
Aelius: [Neutral] Well, um...
Aelius: [Neutral] ...

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Positive] Hello everybody!
Hestia: [Neutral] I thought today would be a good day to have a pleasant gathering with us all.

<<Hide "Hestia">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] Go on.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Neutral] Well, we all know there have been some long-standing... issues amongst the gods.
Hestia: [Positive] I thought that maybe having a get-together would help to ease these tensions.

<<Hide "Hestia">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] You don’t say?

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] Now now, let dear Hestia speak.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] Tch.

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Positive] And I wanted Aelius here to be able to help.

-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’d like to help if I can.
    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>
    Aphrodite: [Positive] Thank you, dear.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_FirstRoundStart>>
-> Aelius: [Smirk] We’re, uh... all friends here... right?
    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>
    Ares: [Neutral] No.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_FirstRoundStart>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] Yeah... someone’s gotta do it, I guess.
    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>
    Ares: [Negative] That’s not true.
