title: Aelius_Day_SecondRound_Ares
---
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "new_dining_area">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Negative] What more is there to say about him?
Aelius: [Neutral] Well... you did steal his wife.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] That’s not how I would describe it.

Aelius: [Neutral] Fair enough.
Aelius: [Neutral] But still, there’s some tension.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Negative] Oh really now?

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] Come now, Ares, we know it needs to be resolved after all this time.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] *Scoffs.*
Aelius: [Neutral] So tell me your side, Ares.
Ares: [Negative] I don’t have to explain myself to a mortal.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Negative] Ares.

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] *Sigh.* Fine.
Ares: [Neutral] Aphrodite was more interested in me, so...
Ares: [Neutral] I took the opportunity.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Negative] You know perfectly well that that’s not the case.
Aphrodite: [Negative] I am not an opportunity.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Negative] How could I not see that as an opportunity after seeing your ruinous relationship?

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Negative] I’m gonna go get some air.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Negative] Dramatic...

Aelius: [Negative] Ares. What was that?
Ares: [Negative] What was what?

-> Aelius: [Negative] Was that necessary?
    Ares: [Negative] Was I wrong?
    Aelius: [Negative] Yes.
    Ares: [Negative] It’s not my fault she’s so sensitive.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_AresConflictBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Negative] Seriously man? That wasn’t cool.
    Ares: [Negative] So what?
    Ares: [Negative] She’s overreacting.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_AresConflictBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Negative] You’re being an ass.
    Ares: [Negative] What’s an outsider to tell me my place?
    <<jump Aelius_Day_AresConflictBottle>>
===


