<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] Must we?
Aelius: [Neutral] ... Yeah.
Hera: [Negative] Why? Hermes is an insolent child!
Hera: [Negative] He has no manners nor decorum, and an egregious lack of respect for his superiors.
Hera: [Negative] I can not stand his “jokes.”

-> Aelius: [Neutral] I can understand where you’re coming from.
    Hera: [Neutral] I am glad someone else can see how... annoying he is.
    Aelius: [Neutral] Some of it was out of line.
    Aelius: [Neutral] Even if he wasn’t wrong per say, it was wrong to joke about it.
    Hera: [Neutral] *Sighs* I suppose.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_HeraConflictBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Smirk] Not even some of them?
    Hera: [Negative] Child.
    Aelius: [Negative] Right, yeah... sorry.
    Hera: [Negative] He shouldn’t make jokes about such sensitive topics.
    Aelius: [Neutral] Yeah... Probably not.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_HeraConflictBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] You’re overthinking it.
    Hera: [Negative] Oh, am I?
    Hera: [Negative] Or is he just out of line?
    Aelius: [Neutral] He wasn’t wrong at least.
    Hera: [Negative] He shouldn’t have joked about such a matter.
    Aelius: [Neutral] Yeah... Probably not.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_HeraConflictBottle>>
