title: Aelius_Day_AfterMainCooking
---
<<Fade "#000000" 1 0 0.4>>
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "new_dining_area">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] ... has been discussing us so much, when we all know the real reason Hestia brought the mortal here.

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] Yeah, something about how the mortal is the child of an Olympian.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Negative] This really doesn’t need to be discussed-

<<Hide "Hestia">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] I agree with Hestia, I do not think this is necessary.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] Really? I think this matter ought to be dealt with.

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] Either Zeus, Hermes, or Hephaestus fathered a kid none of us knew about.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>

Aelius: [Neutral] *Clears throat.*

<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] ...

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Neutral] I’m sorry you had to hear that, Aelius.

Aelius: [Neutral] It’s... fine.

<<if $aeliusMainFood == "MakenaTestScene5">>
    Aelius: [Neutral] I have everyone’s Erymanthian Boar Sandwiches ready.
<<else>>
    Aelius: [Neutral] I have everyone’s Helios Steak ready.
<<endif>>

-> Aelius: [Neutral] Hope you all like it.
    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>
    Hera: [Neutral] Thank you.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_MainFoodBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] Can’t gossip on an empty stomach.
    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>
    Ares: [Neutral] *Rolls eyes.*
    <<jump Aelius_Day_MainFoodBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] Here.
    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>
    Aphrodite: [Neutral] ... Thank you.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_MainFoodBottle>>
