title: Aelius_Day_MainFoodBottle
---
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "new_dining_area">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] This looks nice, Aelius.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] So, Aelius, how about you tell us about yourself?
Hera: [Neutral] Why you’re here, perhaps?

Aelius: [Neutral] ... What about it?

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] Do you know which one it is yet?

Aelius: [Neutral] I, uh... no?

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] Poor thing.

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

Aphrodite: [Neutral] I’m sorry, dear.

<<Hide "Aphrodite">>
<<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>

Ares: [Neutral] Well, it’s definitely one of them.

<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Neutral] You don’t have to talk about it if you don’t want to, Aelius.

Aelius: [Negative] No. I... I should probably talk about it.
Aelius: [Negative] It’s been rough.

-> Aelius: [Negative] I’m not sure what I should be doing with myself.
    Aelius: [Negative] I’m still trying to process my mom’s death.
    Aelius: [Negative] And now all of this... I don’t know what to think of it.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_FatherTalkBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’m just here at this point.
    Aelius: [Neutral] If you guys got any ideas, I’m all ears.
    Aelius: [Negative] I’m still not really over my mom dying, and with all of this on top of that...
    <<jump Aelius_Day_FatherTalkBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] Do any of you understand the feeling of having a mystery dad?
    Aelius: [Neutral] Because I sure as shit don’t know how to handle it.
    Aelius: [Neutral] My mom is dead. I don’t even know how to handle that yet.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_FatherTalkBottle>>
===


title: Aelius_Day_FatherTalkBottle
---
