title: Aelius_Day_FatherSuspicionBottle
---
<<Hide "Ares">>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>

Hera: [Neutral] I suppose I can see that.

Aelius: [Negative] It’s been... weird.
Aelius: [Neutral] It was always just me and my mom, no sort of dad in the picture.

<<Hide "Hera">>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>

