-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’m honestly not sure.
    Aelius: [Neutral] I’m kinda used to having no dad at this point.
    <<Hide "Aphrodite">>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>
    Hera: [Neutral] It could be beneficial.
    <<Hide "Hera">>
    <<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>
    Ares: [Neutral] It’s not always easy having a dad, but I’m glad I have one.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_DessertChoice>>
-> Aelius: [Smirk] Well y’know, when in Olympus...
    Aelius: [Smirk] ... Do as the Olympians do.
    <<Hide "Aphrodite">>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>
    Hera: [Negative] ...
    <<Hide "Hera">>
    <<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" right bottom #ff99cc>>
    Aphrodite: [Neutral] It’s always good to remain in high spirits.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_DessertChoice>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] Yeah, he needs to take some responsibility.
    Aelius: [Negative] It was hard on my mom being a single parent.
    <<Hide "Aphrodite">>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>
    Hera: [Neutral] Parenting is quite the task, I can’t imagine doing it alone.
    <<Hide "Hera">>
    <<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>
    Ares: [Neutral] But that experience made you both stronger for it.
