title: Aelius_Day_HermesKitchenTalk
---
<<Fade "#000000" 1 0 0.4>>
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "main_kitchen_bg_2">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hermes" "Hermes 3_4" right bottom #00ffff>>

Aelius: [Neutral] Sorry, figured it’d be easier to chat in here.
Hermes: [Wink] Ooo, juicy gossip? There’s gotta be if so many people are here at once.
Aelius: [Neutral] Well, kinda...
Aelius: [Smirk] Actually, yes. Yes there is.
Hermes: [Neutral] Well? Do tell.
Aelius: [Neutral] This all was Hestia’s idea. She figured with me here and getting closer to everyone, that maybe I could help fix some of the tension on Olympus.
Hermes: [Wink] Ah, so you’re a goodwill-creating guinea pig.
Hermes: [Wink] Nice.
Aelius: [Positive] *Laughs* Guess I am.
Aelius: [Neutral] Anyway, thanks for delivering the wine. Hestia’s been excited about it.
Hermes: [Positive] No problemo, ‘tis my job.
Hermes: [Neutral] But...
Aelius: [Neutral] Uh oh, what..?
Hermes: [Positive] How about I hang around for a bit. Maybe I can help.
Hermes: [Wink] After all, I see a lot during my deliveries around here. Insider info, if you will.
Aelius: [Neutral] Uh huh...
Hermes: [Neutral] So... how about it?
Aelius: [Neutral] Sure, why not. Not a half bad idea, really.
Aelius: [Neutral] But uh... just a warning. Hera might hate you currently.
Hermes: [Wink] Psh, I’ll be fine. She’ll get over it.
Hermes: [Positive] I’ll go find a seat, see ya soon.

<<Fade "#000000" 0 1 0.35>>
<<wait 0.4>>
<<HideAll>>

<<if $aeliusDessert == "AmbrosiaCake5">>
    <<StartCooking "AmbrosiaCake5">>
<<else>>
    <<StartCooking "LotusParfait4">>
<<endif>>
===


