Aelius: [Neutral] Aphrodite, you should talk to him.

-> Aelius: [Neutral] At least smooth things out between you two.
    <<Hide "Hermes">>
    <<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>
