    <<Hide "Hestia">>
    <<Act "Ares" "Ares" right bottom #cc0000>>
    Ares: [Neutral] Maybe he wouldn’t be such a sourpuss anymore.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_AphroditeResolutionBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Smirk] Before he makes a statue of you for company.
    <<Hide "Hermes">>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>
    Hera: [Negative] Again.
    <<Hide "Hera">>
    <<Act "Hermes" "Hermes 3_4" right bottom #00ffff>>
    Hermes: [Positive] Hehehe.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_AphroditeResolutionBottle>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] I feel like this has gone on long enough.
    <<Hide "Hermes">>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" right bottom #674ea7>>
    Hera: [Neutral] Yes, you two should get over your problems with each other after all this time.
    <<Hide "Hera">>
    <<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>
    Hestia: [Negative] I do agree. I dislike all the tension here on Olympus.
    <<jump Aelius_Day_AphroditeResolutionBottle>>
